{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Game Currency.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Game Currency.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"game currency game currency","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Game Currency.md","fileName":"Game Currency.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Game Currency","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 14:36\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Game Economies]] [[Game Rewards and Consequences]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Economies","Game Rewards and Consequences","System Sink","Reward","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Game Currency.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Game Currency.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"game currency game currency","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Game Currency.md","fileName":"Game Currency.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Game Currency","heading":"Game Currency","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A game currency is a broadly usable resource that mediates exchange without being transformed into the object purchased. Unlike a production input, it can in principle circulate and enable later transactions.\n\nGames often remove spent currency through a [[System Sink]], even when the fiction implies continued circulation. A currency remains useful only while players perceive it as valuable and have meaningful alternatives for spending or saving it.\n\nCurrency is a flexible [[Reward]] because its value can be divided and held for later use. The choice to exchange it now or save toward a different opportunity makes the resource a means of enabling future verbs and objects.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Economies","Game Rewards and Consequences","System Sink","Reward","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Game Currency.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Game Currency.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"game currency game currency","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Game Currency.md","fileName":"Game Currency.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Game Currency","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[advancedgamedesign.pdf]]\n[[agamedesignvocabulary.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Economies","Game Rewards and Consequences","System Sink","Reward","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}